{"speciesId":154,"names":{"fr":"Méganium","es":"Meganium","en":"Meganium","ja":"メガニウム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"The aroma that rises from its petals contains a substance that calms aggressive feelings."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"MEGANIUM's breath has the power to revive dead grass and plants. It can make them healthy again."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Anyone who stands beside it becomes refreshed, just as if they were relaxing in a sunny forest."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The fragrance of MEGANIUM’s flower soothes and calms emotions. In battle, this POKéMON gives off more of its becalming scent to blunt the foe’s fighting spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"The fragrance of MEGANIUM’s flower soothes and calms emotions. In battle, this POKéMON gives off more of its becalming scent to blunt the foe’s fighting spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The fragrance of a MEGANIUM’s flower soothes and calms emotions. In battle, it gives off more of its becalming scent to blunt the foe’s fighting spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"MEGANIUM’s breath has the power to revive dead grass and plants. It can make them healthy again."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The aroma that rises from its petals contains a substance that calms aggressive feelings."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The aroma that rises from its petals contains a substance that calms aggressive feelings."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"MEGANIUM’s breath has the power to r